{"id": "34556", "title": "爱要说出来", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34556.htm", "intro": "童养媳？哇！都什么年代了,还时兴这玩意啊！真是可怜了她那貌美如花的小学妹了, 小小年纪便已今生注定和这小鬼兜一生了。瞧瞧这小鬼,不过是个十二啷噹岁的小六生,看的是原文书,老成持重得像个拘谨小绅士——一看也知是那种财大势大的大户人家养出来的小霸王！真是不可爱的小鬼啊！可,她这么多事做啥咧？被绑架的是他,她凑什么热闹来着？为了护他,她俏脸上还被划了一刀……完了完了,她破相了……啊？他要娶她？就为了她脸上那道刀痕吗？呵！谁理当年那些童言童语啊！可,为了解救她那可人的小学妹,她也只好李代桃僵了——呜……这会儿她真是「僵」住了！老天,她可不可以逃婚啊？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34556", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2191425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191443.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191444.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191445.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191446.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191448.html", "availa